# FPL Projections

A modern Fantasy Premier League dashboard inspired by FPL Insights, built as a static GitHub Pages app.

## Features
- Dark mode interface
- Player database with filtering and search
- Team builder with local storage persistence
- Fixture difficulty matrix
- xP prediction model
- Mobile-first layout
- Daily automated updates via GitHub Actions
- GitHub Pages deployment ready

## Local development
Open `index.html` directly in a browser, or run a local server:

```bash
python3 -m http.server 8000
```

Then visit `http://localhost:8000`.

## GitHub Pages
The repository includes a Pages deployment workflow in `.github/workflows/pages.yml`.

## Data automation
The update workflow runs daily to refresh `data/players.json` and `data/fixtures.json` using the official FPL API.
